{"text": "In the town of Vladimir lived a young merchant named Ivan Dmitrich Aksionov, who had two shops and a house of his own. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was a handsome man with fair, curly hair, and he was full of fun and very fond of singing. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> As a young man he had sometimes drunk too much, but after his marriage he gave it up, except now and then. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> One summer, as he was setting off for the great fair at Nizhny, his wife said, Ivan Dmitrich, do not start today. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I had a bad dream about you, she went on, and in it you came home with hair that was quite gray. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Aksionov only laughed and said that it was a lucky sign, and he promised to bring presents home from the fair. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Halfway there he met a merchant he knew, and the two men had tea together and slept in neighboring rooms at an inn. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Aksionov did not like to sleep late, so he woke his driver before dawn and set off while the air was still cool. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> About twenty five miles on, he stopped at another inn to feed the horses, and sitting on the porch, he began to play his guitar.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "t", "o", "w", "n", " ", "o", "f", " ", "V", "l", "a", "d", "i", "m", "i", "r", " ", "l", "i", "v", "e", "d", " ", "a", " ", "y", "o", "u", "n", "g", " ", "m", "e", "r", "c", "h", "a", "n", "t", " ", "n", "a", "m", "e", "d", " ", "I", "v", "a", "n", " ", "D", "m", "i", "t", "r", "i", "c", "h", " ", "A", "k", "s", "i", "o", "n", "o", "v", ",", " ", "w", "h", "o", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "t", "w", "o", " ", "s", "h", "o", "p", "s", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "a", " ", "h", "o", "u", "s", "e", " ", "o", "f", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "o", "w", "n", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "a", " ", "h", "a", "n", 